: 1509980, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwd3w.jpg"}, {"id": 1509981, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwd3x.jpg"}, {"id": 1509982, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwd3y.jpg"}, {"id": 1509983, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwd3z.jpg"}, {"id": 1509984, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwd40.jpg"}, {"id": 1509985, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwd41.jpg"}, {"id": 1509986, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwd42.jpg"}], "slug": "sports-renovations", "storyline": "Your hometown basketball court is in danger. The shining star of your youth where you watched fantastic matches played by your favourite team. It\u2019s a place where many young talents started their careers. It\u2019s a home of many fond memories, now covered in cobwebs and dust.\n\nThe court is deteriorating rapidly. A big developer is only waiting to get his grubby hands on the place, tear it down and build a new shopping mall instead. But you won\u2019t accept that.\n\nDo what you do best! Grab your tools, roll up your sleeves and breathe some life into other old sports facilities to earn money. See the spaces normally unavailable to normal visitors. Learn the inner workings of sports and listen to fascinating tales about their history.\n\nAnd when you\u2019ve earned enough, step up and renovate your hometown\u2019s court.", "summary": "Give sports facilities a second life in this relaxing first-person simulator! Restore the glory of old gyms, courts and pitches as you try to make enough money to save your hometown basketball court.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sports-renovations", "videos": [{"id": 146503, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "ngfAkwugDvc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ngfAkwugDvc", "title": "SPORTS RENOVATIONS - Release date trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ngfAkwugDvc/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}